{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/b59a05658e1aeb8b961e2d5aee1a1c55.poster.avif?t=1761870870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/b59a05658e1aeb8b961e2d5aee1a1c55.webm?t=1761870870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/b59a05658e1aeb8b961e2d5aee1a1c55.mp4?t=1761870870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a Border Business Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a small checkpoint: a single barrier and empty lots.<br>Open new businesses \u2014 from a modest mini-market and pizzeria to a gas station, hotel, or cinema.<br>Each business generates income that helps you expand and upgrade your post.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade the barrier to speed up work, reduce waiting lines, and increase traffic flow \u2014 so the money keeps rolling in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/88840e6aadf1c5e6cc4c3b63f0ba1247.poster.avif?t=1761870870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/88840e6aadf1c5e6cc4c3b63f0ba1247.webm?t=1761870870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/88840e6aadf1c5e6cc4c3b63f0ba1247.mp4?t=1761870870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Check Vehicles \u2014 Make the Call</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you\u2019ll have to step onto the road and press the <strong>\u201cCheck\u201d</strong> button.<br>Passengers will share their stories \u2014 sometimes touching, sometimes suspicious.<br>Your decision to let them through or hold them back affects both your checkpoint\u2019s reputation and your income.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Service Station","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022730/078ec1c73ea336ebb71896660d1ca7a8e6fded79.jpg"},{"name":"Gas Station","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022730/b766b42c7811102987203ffaf9eb43d0d2dbc9fd.jpg"},{"name":"Cinema","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022730/3e17a6019bf91094ab4d3814cd0f123f883975a5.jpg"},{"name":"Autobahn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022730/2e71536de4eaa34ca1235ae7576d2737adfc1d83.jpg"},{"name":"Checkpoint Chief","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022730/2a326c5706ba63f64df5ceafe61e3cd87253b1d2.jpg"},{"name":"Backstab","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022730/55ffdd015cde5d3572aaa61d1531242b20b063e8.jpg"},{"name":"For Money","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022730/e768f74393b64665264b8ea8ce150749b0e6eefb.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022730?t=1761870870","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022730?t=1761870870","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/c4b6f13f970d4866f13317416f0c4eca8903de84/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761870870","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/c4b6f13f970d4866f13317416f0c4eca8903de84/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761870870","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Cust